=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> as an argument.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> <div class=\"t-noexcept-inline\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span></span></span></div>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>To iterate over the current directory, construct the iterator as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">directory_iterator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\".\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> instead of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">directory_iterator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"},{"path":"experimental/fs/directory_iterator","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::directory_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::directory_iterator::directory_iterator","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"5 declarations. Constructs a new directory iterator."},{"label":"Parameters"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"noexcept specification: noexcept"},{"label":"Notes","note":"To iterate over the current directory, construct the iterator as directory_iterator(\".\") instead of directory_iterator(\"\")."}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":128,"codeBlockCount":0}
